    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d157">

                <pb facs="0337" n="249" xml:id="pg249"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2766b: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Feely</hi>)<anchor n="20"
                        xml:id="d157-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-01-10T13:00:00-05:00">January 10, 1933—1
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2. [Here follows text of paragraph 1 of telegram No. 4, January 10, 1 p.m., to
                    the Ambassador in Peru, printed <hi rendition="#italic">supra</hi>.]</p>
                <p>Please cable any information discreetly obtainable, whether this plan has been
                    discussed with the Government to which you are accredited, and whether it seems
                    likely that it meets with its approval.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Castle</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d157-f1" n="20" type="source" xml:id="d157-f1-content">
                <p>The same, January 10, 1 p.m., to the Minister in Paraguay as telegram No. 1.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
